1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:01,792
Jeg testet disse på hundeluftingen

2
00:00:01,792 --> 00:00:02,359
i morges.

3
00:00:02,359 --> 00:00:04,451
Jeg var litt skeptisk for å være

4
00:00:04,451 --> 00:00:06,477
ærlig, men jeg tok på meg disse

5
00:00:06,477 --> 00:00:07,879
før turen i morges.

6
00:00:07,879 --> 00:00:10,154
Vått, gjørmete, snø overalt.

7
00:00:10,154 --> 00:00:12,835
Etterpå, helt tørre sokker, ingen

8
00:00:12,835 --> 00:00:14,867
snø i skoene, ingen grus,

9
00:00:14,867 --> 00:00:15,739
ingenting.

10
00:00:15,739 --> 00:00:17,340
De satt på hele veien.

11
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:19,459
Ikke noe styr, ingenting som gled

12
00:00:19,459 --> 00:00:19,716
ned.

13
00:00:19,716 --> 00:00:21,579
Nå tar jeg dem med hver gang.

14
00:00:21,579 --> 00:00:23,569
Skogen, hundeturen, vandringen,

15
00:00:23,569 --> 00:00:24,399
samme greia.

16
00:00:24,399 --> 00:00:26,328
Enkel sak, men den fungerer

17
00:00:26,328 --> 00:00:27,499
faktisk.
